  "content": {
    "_uid": "fcd40962-a33d-7ab2-9c66-1218c1653ba7",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "5f698412-a1dd-36ca-8fe1-3e5740729e94",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The workshops were opened by Service Line Chief Dr. Nuzhat Faruqui who highlighted the importance of continuous education and its impact on patient care. The workshops were blended with case based scenarios and discussion. Participants were fascinated by the scenarios, in which participants performed risk and focused assessment of patients having nephrology disorders, urological emergencies and pre-, intra- and post-dialysis complication management brought to life by SimMan 3G. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Debriefing focused on comparing actual performance with desired performance. These workshops were an outstanding display of collaboration by the service line administrative staff and CIME staff.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
