    "show_share": true,
    "description": "'Happy Kidney, Healthy Life Month' was celebrated by Urology and Nephrology Service Line in March 2018. Simulation workshops were held for capacity building in Nephrology, Urology, and Hemodialysis nurses and technicians. The workshops were designed to teach Evidence Based Practice (EBP) via simulation.",
